From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mingyu Lei <leimy@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 04:41:47 -0700
Subject: FSA: Wait for pending writes before closing the file writer

FileSystemAccessFileWriterImpl::CloseImpl started the safe-move of the
swap file (including hashing it for the after-write check) without
verifying that previously dispatched WriteStream or Truncate operations
had completed. The renderer-side FileSystemUnderlyingSink already
enforces this ordering, but the browser side did not.

Track the number of in-flight operations and defer starting the
safe-move until all of them have finished, so that the after-write hash
and the file that is moved into place always reflect the final swap file
contents.

